/*!
    \qmlmodule GroupQml 1.0
    \title Group QML
    \brief A QML module for the shared comment group fixture.
*/

/*!
    \qmltype Trio
    \inqmlmodule GroupQml
    \brief A QML type that carries a shared property group.

    The alpha, beta, and gamma properties share a comment; solo stands
    on its own. Other groups exercise status sentences.
*/

/*!
    \qmlproperty double Trio::alpha
    \qmlproperty double Trio::beta
    \qmlproperty double Trio::gamma

    These three properties do the same work together. The shared
    comment that documents them refers to the ungrouped property
    \l GroupQml::Trio::solo and to a target that does not exist:
    \l BrokenTarget

    \sa GroupQml::Trio::solo
*/

/*!
    \qmlproperty double Trio::solo
    \since 6.1

    The ungrouped property stands on its own.

    It links back to one of the grouped properties:
    \l GroupQml::Trio::alpha

    \sa GroupQml::Trio::alpha
*/

/*!
    \qmlmethod void Trio::open()
    \qmlmethod void Trio::close()
    \deprecated [7.0]

    Opens or closes the trio with one shared description.

    \sa GroupQml::Trio::solo
*/

/*!
    \qmlpropertygroup Trio::font
    \qmlproperty string Trio::font.family
    \qmlproperty int Trio::font.pixelSize
    \deprecated [7.0]

    The font settings form one named property group.

    \sa GroupQml::Trio::solo
*/
